          <a href='mailto:telemedicine@spmh.co.ke' class='font-bold text-primary hover:underline'>email telemedicine@spmh.co.ke</a><br />
          <span class='text-xs text-slate-600'>Available Mon–Sat, 8 AM–5 PM</span>
